WEBVTT

00:00:00.430 --> 00:00:02.100
So the wish does come true.

00:00:02.810 --> 00:00:05.400
But the one who granted it wasn't me, the Selector,

00:00:05.690 --> 00:00:07.190
but Hanayo-san, the LRIG.

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:10.110
That's the Eternal Girl.

00:00:10.320 --> 00:00:11.110
That's...

00:00:12.360 --> 00:00:14.410
the truth behind these battles.

00:00:29.960 --> 00:00:32.130
Hitoe!

00:00:43.690 --> 00:00:44.730
Hitoe!

00:00:44.730 --> 00:00:46.020
Hitoe...

00:00:46.020 --> 00:00:47.020
Ruuko!

00:00:47.480 --> 00:00:49.860
We need an ambulance! Call an ambulance!

00:00:50.150 --> 00:00:52.740
R-Right! A phone—

00:00:52.740 --> 00:00:55.200
Hitoe has a cell phone with her! Hurry!

00:00:56.160 --> 00:00:57.570
O-Okay!

00:01:12.340 --> 00:01:17.470
shinjitsu wa hitoe ni kaado no uraomote
Truth and reality are like the two sides of a card

00:01:17.470 --> 00:01:22.970
tokenai mama
Forever entwined

00:01:22.970 --> 00:01:27.790
mekurimekuru meku
Thrust upon this chaotic stage

00:01:27.790 --> 00:01:31.730
memagurushii suteeji de
I spin around and lose my way

00:01:31.730 --> 00:01:32.980
memagurushii suteeji de
memagurushii suteeji de
I spin around and lose my way
I spin around and lose my way

00:01:32.980 --> 00:01:41.030
sono karamatta kanjou wo manzoku iku made nankai mo
Until I can finally sort out these mixed-up emotions

00:01:41.030 --> 00:01:44.290
kowashite shimae
I'll destroy it countless times

00:01:44.290 --> 00:01:49.380
unmei ni temaneki sare samayou ashita wa
The uncertain future will be summoned by fate

00:01:49.380 --> 00:01:54.670
nani wo erande nani wo tebanashi hitotsu ni nareba iin darou
Should I choose just one thing to let go of?

00:01:54.670 --> 00:02:00.430
najitta tefuda wo sarasu yoyuu nante nai yo
I can't afford to let my sinful hand show yet

00:02:00.430 --> 00:02:05.520
kawaita koukai no umi wo nomihosu hibi wa
My days of leisurely drinking from the sea of regret are long over

00:02:05.520 --> 00:02:10.860
kagirareta kotoba de itsushika no egao yurushite hoshiin darou
Will you really use your one wish to return that lost smile?

00:02:11.020 --> 00:02:17.070
utsutsu wo wasuretatte kamawanai yo dakara
It's no concern of mine if you avert your eyes from reality

00:02:17.070 --> 00:02:21.820
ima wa shiranai de itai nee
So please just live in blissful ignorance

00:02:30.920 --> 00:02:32.880
Yes, she's fine.

00:02:32.880 --> 00:02:35.760
The doctor said she's stable.

00:02:36.210 --> 00:02:39.630
Yeah, I called them already.

00:02:39.630 --> 00:02:46.890
And, well... I'd like to wait until Hitoe's mom gets here.

00:02:47.810 --> 00:02:48.890
I see.

00:02:49.640 --> 00:02:53.860
She's your friend. Of course you'd want to stay by her side.

00:02:55.070 --> 00:02:56.570
Ruu-chan...

00:02:57.360 --> 00:02:58.860
are <i>you</i> okay?

00:03:00.030 --> 00:03:02.160
Yeah, I'm okay.

00:03:02.910 --> 00:03:05.450
I'll call if something comes up.

00:03:26.430 --> 00:03:28.180
You were right.

00:03:32.150 --> 00:03:34.310
I shouldn't have gone on battling.

00:03:34.310 --> 00:03:37.150
Yuzuki... What happened?

00:03:37.610 --> 00:03:38.990
What happened?

00:03:39.740 --> 00:03:43.110
I won the battle, and then...

00:03:45.160 --> 00:03:46.620
<i>You...</i>

00:03:47.910 --> 00:03:50.000
<i>will become a LRIG.</i>

00:03:56.250 --> 00:03:57.840
Where am I...?

00:04:05.260 --> 00:04:07.470
Wh-What?

00:04:07.470 --> 00:04:08.510
Nice to meet you,

00:04:14.270 --> 00:04:15.650
Yuzuki-san.

00:04:18.570 --> 00:04:19.570
Wh-Who are you?

00:04:20.110 --> 00:04:21.650
I am

00:04:21.650 --> 00:04:22.740
Mayu.

00:04:25.950 --> 00:04:27.450
Mayu?

00:04:27.450 --> 00:04:33.960
She told me all about Selectors, LRIGs, and Eternal Girls.

00:04:34.370 --> 00:04:38.130
She said that all girls who become LRIGs go there.

00:04:38.130 --> 00:04:40.170
Hanayo-san and the others had been there, too?

00:04:40.420 --> 00:04:41.800
I don't know.

00:04:42.760 --> 00:04:45.010
White room...

00:04:45.010 --> 00:04:46.760
Tama, do you know anything about it?

00:04:47.760 --> 00:04:50.100
Tama doesn't know...

00:04:50.100 --> 00:04:53.350
Who is this Mayu?

00:04:53.350 --> 00:04:55.690
Her name is all I know.

00:04:56.060 --> 00:04:57.400
I see...

00:04:58.310 --> 00:05:02.190
I guess Hanayo-san was deceiving me all this time.

00:05:03.240 --> 00:05:07.030
I was never told that LRIGs replace their Selectors.

00:05:07.030 --> 00:05:10.870
She's probably walking around in my body somewhere out there right now...

00:05:11.950 --> 00:05:15.210
She kept telling me how she
would help me with my wish,

00:05:15.210 --> 00:05:16.920
taking me for a fool all the while...

00:05:16.920 --> 00:05:17.330
Yuzu—

00:05:17.330 --> 00:05:18.920
Or so I thought.

00:05:20.000 --> 00:05:21.050
But...

00:05:22.380 --> 00:05:23.460
How cruel...

00:05:23.880 --> 00:05:26.220
You're so cruel, Hanayo-san!

00:05:26.800 --> 00:05:27.970
You must know

00:05:28.550 --> 00:05:31.600
that LRIGs are not allowed to share the truth with their Selectors.

00:05:31.600 --> 00:05:34.180
Why do <i>you</i> know all this?!

00:05:34.180 --> 00:05:36.890
Who are you?! <i>What</i> are you?!

00:05:39.560 --> 00:05:41.360
If a LRIG breaks this rule,

00:05:42.110 --> 00:05:46.450
and her Selector learns the truth
and starts to decline battles as a result,

00:05:46.450 --> 00:05:51.120
she loses her chance to ever escape from the card.

00:05:53.790 --> 00:05:54.750
That means...

00:05:55.410 --> 00:05:58.290
you're doing the same to Hitoe now?

00:05:59.500 --> 00:06:02.500
After that, I...

00:06:09.890 --> 00:06:12.390
<i>Nice to meet you, Selector.</i>

00:06:14.180 --> 00:06:15.350
I couldn't believe it.

00:06:15.810 --> 00:06:19.100
Of all people, I had to become Hitoe's LRIG.

00:06:19.810 --> 00:06:22.270
"What do I do now?" I thought.

00:06:22.270 --> 00:06:27.070
"Do I have to deceive Hitoe now and make her battle again?" I wondered.

00:06:27.400 --> 00:06:31.620
"If I don't, I'll never be able to get out of here."

00:06:31.910 --> 00:06:33.950
"Still, I..."

00:06:35.410 --> 00:06:37.370
<i>Let's get along, Hitoe!</i>

00:06:38.830 --> 00:06:41.790
<i>Why... do you know my name?</i>

00:06:41.790 --> 00:06:44.380
<i>Of course I'd know it!</i>

00:06:48.340 --> 00:06:52.680
We called each other friends, but we only really knew each other for a short time.

00:06:52.680 --> 00:06:56.310
Either way, she's completely forgotten about the both of us.

00:06:56.970 --> 00:06:59.310
<i>I'll be your LRIG from today.</i>

00:07:00.190 --> 00:07:02.730
<i>My... "LRIG"?</i>

00:07:02.730 --> 00:07:04.730
<i>What is your wish?</i>

00:07:06.650 --> 00:07:08.400
<i>My wish...</i>

00:07:08.400 --> 00:07:10.820
<i>If you have a wish, I can make it come true.</i>

00:07:11.240 --> 00:07:13.240
<i>I'm Yuzuki.</i>

00:07:13.240 --> 00:07:15.080
<i>Let's make your wish come true, together.</i>

00:07:15.410 --> 00:07:17.790
<i>Yu... zu... ki...</i>

00:07:22.750 --> 00:07:24.500
"I want to go back outside."

00:07:25.590 --> 00:07:29.130
"Even if it takes hurting Hitoe."

00:07:29.130 --> 00:07:32.470
"Kazuki... I want to see Kazuki!"

00:07:32.470 --> 00:07:34.300
That's what I thought.

00:07:34.300 --> 00:07:37.770
<i>So, can you tell me what your wish is?</i>

00:07:40.180 --> 00:07:41.770
<i>My wish...</i>

00:07:42.900 --> 00:07:44.060
<i>Hitoe?</i>

00:07:44.270 --> 00:07:46.860
<i>Hitoe! What's the matter?</i>

00:07:46.860 --> 00:07:49.990
<i>Are you okay? Hitoe? Hitoe?!</i>

00:07:49.990 --> 00:07:52.490
I knew she didn't have a wish.

00:07:53.990 --> 00:07:54.660
But...

00:07:56.120 --> 00:07:59.870
I had to hold on to the only chance I had.

00:08:00.870 --> 00:08:01.960
And then...

00:08:06.170 --> 00:08:11.760
Just when I had begun to think about giving up...

00:08:28.900 --> 00:08:30.070
<i>Hitoe?</i>

00:08:33.320 --> 00:08:35.530
<i>Hitoe? Does it hurt?</i>

00:08:37.030 --> 00:08:38.780
<i>Why are you doing this to yourself?</i>

00:08:39.490 --> 00:08:42.910
<i>I don't know.... but...</i>

00:08:42.910 --> 00:08:46.460
<i>it must be important to me.</i>

00:08:48.840 --> 00:08:49.920
<i>I...</i>

00:08:50.590 --> 00:08:53.300
<i>have a wish...</i>

00:08:56.220 --> 00:08:58.050
<i>Friends...</i>

00:08:58.890 --> 00:09:02.520
<i>I want...  friends.</i>

00:09:04.270 --> 00:09:06.730
After all the horrible things she had gone through...

00:09:07.940 --> 00:09:10.570
After all the pain she had gone through...

00:09:12.230 --> 00:09:14.150
She asked for the <i>same thing</i> again.

00:09:20.830 --> 00:09:23.620
<i>I want... friends.</i>

00:09:37.220 --> 00:09:38.180
<i>Got it.</i>

00:09:39.300 --> 00:09:41.560
<i>I'll make your wish come true.</i>

00:09:42.850 --> 00:09:45.180
Seeing her cry sealed the deal.

00:09:45.180 --> 00:09:49.770
They say you can't deny a girl anything when she's in tears, and they're right.

00:09:57.570 --> 00:10:01.160
<i>My wish... Hitoe's wish...</i>

00:10:01.530 --> 00:10:04.540
<i>A wish that requires a sacrifice to come true.</i>

00:10:05.910 --> 00:10:10.250
<i>I wonder if Hanayo-san had the same thoughts...</i>

00:10:11.500 --> 00:10:16.630
<i>I wonder if Hanayo-san felt
just as lost and tormented as I do...</i>

00:10:20.510 --> 00:10:21.970
<i>Hanayo-san...</i>

00:10:24.470 --> 00:10:27.430
After that, I started thinking...

00:10:29.140 --> 00:10:30.440
<i>Hey, Hitoe?</i>

00:10:31.560 --> 00:10:34.230
<i>You want your wish to come true, right?</i>

00:10:34.230 --> 00:10:35.690
<i>Let's go out and battle, then.</i>

00:10:37.280 --> 00:10:38.610
<i>Battle.</i>

00:10:39.360 --> 00:10:41.660
I had her battle you, Ruuko.

00:10:41.990 --> 00:10:44.160
And then I spoke the truth.

00:10:45.330 --> 00:10:50.330
I had hoped that Hitoe would
stop battling after she heard it.

00:10:50.330 --> 00:10:53.500
But if she does, then you'll never...!

00:10:54.040 --> 00:10:55.460
I don't care.

00:10:56.340 --> 00:10:58.220
Sacrificing a friend...

00:10:58.220 --> 00:11:02.850
I can't bring myself to sacrifice Hitoe just to get back outside.

00:11:04.260 --> 00:11:09.060
Also, if I can't live as Kurebayashi Yuzuki anymore...

00:11:09.060 --> 00:11:12.810
If I can't love Kazuki as Kurebayashi Yuzuki...

00:11:12.810 --> 00:11:15.690
there's no meaning to a life outside for me.

00:11:16.360 --> 00:11:17.480
Yuzuki...

00:11:17.480 --> 00:11:18.610
Hitoe!

00:11:19.650 --> 00:11:21.820
E-Excuse me...

00:11:21.820 --> 00:11:22.820
Ruuko-san!

00:11:23.410 --> 00:11:25.700
Hitoe—Where's Hitoe?!

00:11:25.700 --> 00:11:29.410
Sh-She's okay... right now.

00:11:29.410 --> 00:11:33.670
She's stable now... the doctor is watching over her.

00:11:39.300 --> 00:11:41.760
I'm sorry. It's fine.

00:11:47.140 --> 00:11:47.970
She scares me.

00:11:49.810 --> 00:11:50.890
Hitoe...

00:11:51.940 --> 00:11:55.900
She was such a sweet girl, but now,
I just don't know what she's thinking anymore.

00:11:56.770 --> 00:11:57.820
She scares me.

00:11:59.570 --> 00:12:02.820
I don't know... I don't know anymore...

00:12:03.320 --> 00:12:06.530
What should I do?

00:12:06.830 --> 00:12:08.160
What should I...?

00:12:25.340 --> 00:12:27.890
Yuzuki, you should sleep over at my house!

00:12:29.140 --> 00:12:30.470
It's my fault...

00:12:31.810 --> 00:12:34.060
I made her battle...

00:12:36.400 --> 00:12:40.650
But you did it for her sake, didn't you?

00:12:41.360 --> 00:12:44.450
Doing something for the sake of others...

00:12:44.450 --> 00:12:46.160
I think that's amazing.

00:12:47.740 --> 00:12:48.660
Ruuko...

00:12:51.620 --> 00:12:55.500
Let's go! This'll be the second time you've stayed over, right?

00:12:55.500 --> 00:12:57.750
H-Hey, listen...

00:12:57.750 --> 00:13:02.260
Can I ask you a favor before we go?

00:13:18.190 --> 00:13:20.480
Is this okay? Can you see clearly?

00:13:21.530 --> 00:13:22.480
Yeah.

00:13:24.490 --> 00:13:27.950
My, Yuzuki-chan and Kazuki-kun! You're stepping out?

00:13:28.240 --> 00:13:29.870
Just a quick trip to the convenience store.

00:13:29.870 --> 00:13:32.160
It looks like it's just about to snow. Be careful.

00:13:32.160 --> 00:13:33.000
We will.

00:13:33.000 --> 00:13:34.080
Thank you.

00:13:41.920 --> 00:13:43.210
What's the matter, Yuzuki?

00:13:47.470 --> 00:13:49.220
Cornerstone

00:13:56.230 --> 00:13:57.230
Yuzuki?

00:13:59.310 --> 00:14:00.980
I want to stay as your girlfriend, Kazuki.

00:14:07.490 --> 00:14:10.820
This is about the only time we get to spend alone.

00:14:10.820 --> 00:14:13.540
Dad and Mom are at home.

00:14:13.540 --> 00:14:15.290
Everyone else is at school.

00:14:15.950 --> 00:14:21.040
But no one would bat an eye at a brother and sister sharing an umbrella, right?

00:14:26.880 --> 00:14:28.130
What now?

00:14:58.000 --> 00:15:00.960
It's snowing... Kazuki, it's snowing!

00:15:07.380 --> 00:15:08.800
You're strong, Yuzuki.

00:15:10.470 --> 00:15:12.510
You've been strong ever since we were kids.

00:15:13.260 --> 00:15:16.930
You always led the way for me and protected me.

00:15:19.350 --> 00:15:20.770
I guess...

00:15:21.690 --> 00:15:24.610
I've loved you for a long time.

00:15:30.990 --> 00:15:34.370
That's why I'll protect <i>you</i> from now on.

00:15:34.370 --> 00:15:36.910
I'm your boyfriend, after all.

00:16:05.980 --> 00:16:08.570
My wish came true.

00:16:09.400 --> 00:16:12.860
She made my wish come true.

00:16:15.410 --> 00:16:16.950
Thank you...

00:16:18.620 --> 00:16:19.950
Hanayo-san.

00:16:35.890 --> 00:16:38.510
Yuzu... ki?

00:16:40.520 --> 00:16:42.020
<b>Those who do not refuse to select...</b>

00:16:42.020 --> 00:16:42.730
<b>Sending Complete
Those who do not refuse to select...</b>

00:16:42.730 --> 00:16:42.750
So, all prepared and stuff?
<b>Sending Complete
Those who do not refuse to select...</b>

00:16:42.750 --> 00:16:45.350
So, all prepared and stuff?

00:16:45.350 --> 00:16:46.400
Yes.

00:16:46.400 --> 00:16:49.070
I wonder if <i>she</i> will come.

00:16:49.480 --> 00:16:51.570
I'm sure she will.

00:16:52.610 --> 00:16:54.700
We're the same, she and I.

00:16:54.700 --> 00:16:56.490
That's true.

00:16:56.490 --> 00:16:59.910
You and that girl both have nothing but battling on your mind.

00:17:00.290 --> 00:17:02.040
Everything else is empty.

00:17:03.410 --> 00:17:06.630
You really are birds of a feather.

00:17:09.130 --> 00:17:10.460
<i>I don't care.</i>

00:17:10.460 --> 00:17:12.010
<i>Sacrificing a friend...</i>

00:17:12.010 --> 00:17:15.720
<i>I can't bring myself to sacrifice Hitoe just to get back outside.</i>

00:17:16.430 --> 00:17:17.890
<i>A friend...</i>

00:17:19.600 --> 00:17:22.980
<i>My wish came true.</i>

00:17:22.980 --> 00:17:26.140
<i>She made my wish come true.</i>

00:17:27.650 --> 00:17:29.110
<i>A wish...</i>

00:17:31.400 --> 00:17:32.400
<i>A wish.</i>

00:17:46.540 --> 00:17:47.120
Oh?

00:17:47.710 --> 00:17:49.330
Is something the matter, Ruu-chan?

00:17:49.330 --> 00:17:51.960
O-Oh, nothing at all.

00:17:51.960 --> 00:17:54.090
What are you doing, Grandma?

00:17:54.090 --> 00:17:54.880
Look, here.

00:17:55.670 --> 00:17:59.720
It started to snow, so now
I need to wipe the potatoes dry.

00:18:00.390 --> 00:18:01.970
I'll help!

00:18:07.100 --> 00:18:08.600
Grandma?

00:18:08.600 --> 00:18:10.060
Hm?

00:18:10.060 --> 00:18:11.230
You know, I...

00:18:11.770 --> 00:18:18.660
I don't really wish to do anything special or become some important person.

00:18:19.700 --> 00:18:26.580
I always thought... that it didn't really matter whether I had friends or not, either.

00:18:29.040 --> 00:18:30.040
Okay.

00:18:30.460 --> 00:18:35.420
But then I made friends.
I was happy, and I had fun.

00:18:36.130 --> 00:18:39.260
I wanted to be with them as long as I could.

00:18:39.260 --> 00:18:40.390
So...

00:18:40.970 --> 00:18:42.220
Can I...

00:18:43.100 --> 00:18:45.890
Can I do something for my friends, too?

00:18:50.440 --> 00:18:52.520
I'm happy, too.

00:18:53.570 --> 00:18:56.690
I know you can.

00:18:57.860 --> 00:18:59.650
Because you're Ruu-chan.

00:19:04.450 --> 00:19:05.660
Grandma...

00:19:06.040 --> 00:19:07.580
Now then...

00:19:07.580 --> 00:19:09.870
Where should I put these?

00:19:09.870 --> 00:19:13.290
Put them there, where the sun can find them.

00:19:13.290 --> 00:19:14.340
Okay!

00:19:20.180 --> 00:19:21.300
Tama?

00:19:22.140 --> 00:19:24.010
What's wrong, Tama?

00:19:31.600 --> 00:19:34.730
I wonder if you were a normal girl, too.

00:19:36.730 --> 00:19:38.900
I wonder what you were like.

00:19:39.240 --> 00:19:40.650
I wonder what your wish—

00:19:40.650 --> 00:19:41.780
I don't know!

00:19:43.410 --> 00:19:47.240
Tama doesn't know... I don't know anything at all!

00:19:48.080 --> 00:19:49.410
Tama?

00:19:49.410 --> 00:19:51.960
Tama didn't know! Really!

00:19:51.960 --> 00:19:56.130
I didn't know at all that Selectors and LRIGs switch places!

00:19:56.130 --> 00:19:59.130
I'm not lying! It's true, Ruu!

00:19:59.130 --> 00:20:01.880
I just wanted to battle together with Ruu!

00:20:02.720 --> 00:20:04.300
I understand.

00:20:05.350 --> 00:20:06.600
Really?

00:20:06.600 --> 00:20:10.270
Yeah, because you're my friend.

00:20:12.640 --> 00:20:14.150
Ruu...

00:20:17.110 --> 00:20:19.070
It's been a long day!

00:20:20.150 --> 00:20:21.530
Time to sleep!

00:20:24.530 --> 00:20:26.280
Good night, Tama.

00:20:42.510 --> 00:20:43.880
Hey, did you see it?

00:20:43.880 --> 00:20:47.350
Sure! It's some fan gathering for Iona, right?

00:20:47.850 --> 00:20:50.310
What does she mean by "select," though?

00:20:50.770 --> 00:20:52.560
I guess it's about choosing something?

00:20:52.560 --> 00:20:54.440
Well, yeah, but...

00:20:54.850 --> 00:20:56.400
Any idea where it's held?

00:20:57.020 --> 00:20:58.860
It doesn't say anything about that here.

00:20:59.270 --> 00:21:04.030
Oh, that? I sent her a reply,
but she never responded.

00:21:04.030 --> 00:21:05.660
